{
    "title": "\u00cele-de-France Mobilit\u00e9s",
    "description": "\u00cele-de-France Mobilit\u00e9s is there to help you on a daily basis: train, RER, metro, tramway, bus, bicycle, V\u00e9lib', carpooling, carsharing... Find the tools and information you need to organize your travel in \u00cele-de-France. Together, let's make traveling easier.\r\n \r\nAvoid waiting in line at stations: buy your tickets from your phone!\r\nYou can buy the following tickets\r\n- Booklets of t+ tickets\r\n- Navigo day, week or month passes\r\n- Special tickets (Navigo Jeunes Week-end, anti-pollution package...)\r\n- Daily V\u00e9lib' tickets\r\n \r\nPurchased titles can then be recharged on a pass, stored in your phone* or on your compatible connected watch** (giving you the option of validating directly with one of the two).\r\nYou can also save your dematerialised tracks from one Android phone and transfer them to another Android phone.\r\n *Service available on all NFC-enabled smartphones from version Android 8 EXCEPT on the Google Pixel, Pixel 2, Pixel 2XL, Pixel 3, Pixel 3XL, Pixel 3a, Pixel 3a xl, Pixel 4, Pixel 4a, Pixel C, Pixel Slate, Nexus 5X, Nexus 6P and Nocturne. For more information, visit https://www.iledefrance-mobilites.fr/titres-et-tarifs/supports/smartphone\r\n** Service available on Samsung Galaxy Watch Series 4 and above (Wear OS 4).\r\n\r\nThe application also allows you to prepare and plan your trips:\r\n- Find bus stops, train stations and subway stations near you\r\n- Search in real time for your public transport, carpooling and bicycle routes\r\n- Consult the next passages of your lines in real time and all the timetables\r\n- Save your upcoming trips on your phone's calendar\r\n- View public transportation network maps (accessible even offline)\r\n- Follow the pedestrian route for walking sections\r\n \r\nBe the first to know and anticipate disruptions:\r\n- Check the Twitter feed of your lines for real-time traffic information\r\n- Be alerted in case of disruptions on your favorite lines and routes\r\n- Stay informed about the state of the elevators in the stations you use\r\n- Check and report on the number of passengers on your route\r\n \r\nPersonalize your trips:\r\n- Save your destinations (work, home, gym...), stations and train stations as favorites\r\n- Personalize your profile (fast walker, with difficulties, reduced mobility...)\r\n- Select lines or stations to avoid\r\n \r\nFavour soft or alternative modes of transport:\r\n- Prefer the proposed bike routes for all your trips\r\n- Book your carpooling and/or carsharing trips, in partnership with the main French players\r\n- Rent a car or a utility for a short period of time by choosing a Communauto car-sharing vehicle from a large choice of stations around you and reserve it without delay for the duration of your choice.\r\n \r\n--You already use the \u00cele-de-France Mobilit\u00e9s application and appreciate its services? Let us know with 5 stars!\r\nDo you have any bugs or comments to share with us? Help us improve by sending us your suggestions using the contact form available via the menu.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u00cele-de-France Mobilit\u00e9s is there to help you on a daily basis: train, RER, metro, tramway, bus, bicycle, V\u00e9lib&#39;, carpooling, carsharing... Find the tools and information you need to organize your travel in \u00cele-de-France. Together, let&#39;s make traveling easier.<br> <br>Avoid waiting in line at stations: buy your tickets from your phone!<br>You can buy the following tickets<br>- Booklets of t+ tickets<br>- Navigo day, week or month passes<br>- Special tickets (Navigo Jeunes Week-end, anti-pollution package...)<br>- Daily V\u00e9lib&#39; tickets<br> <br>Purchased titles can then be recharged on a pass, stored in your phone* or on your compatible connected watch** (giving you the option of validating directly with one of the two).<br>You can also save your dematerialised tracks from one Android phone and transfer them to another Android phone.<br> *Service available on all NFC-enabled smartphones from version Android 8 EXCEPT on the Google Pixel, Pixel 2, Pixel 2XL, Pixel 3, Pixel 3XL, Pixel 3a, Pixel 3a xl, Pixel 4, Pixel 4a, Pixel C, Pixel Slate, Nexus 5X, Nexus 6P and Nocturne. For more information, visit https://www.iledefrance-mobilites.fr/titres-et-tarifs/supports/smartphone<br>** Service available on Samsung Galaxy Watch Series 4 and above (Wear OS 4).<br><br>The application also allows you to prepare and plan your trips:<br>- Find bus stops, train stations and subway stations near you<br>- Search in real time for your public transport, carpooling and bicycle routes<br>- Consult the next passages of your lines in real time and all the timetables<br>- Save your upcoming trips on your phone&#39;s calendar<br>- View public transportation network maps (accessible even offline)<br>- Follow the pedestrian route for walking sections<br> <br>Be the first to know and anticipate disruptions:<br>- Check the Twitter feed of your lines for real-time traffic information<br>- Be alerted in case of disruptions on your favorite lines and routes<br>- Stay informed about the state of the elevators in the stations you use<br>- Check and report on the number of passengers on your route<br> <br>Personalize your trips:<br>- Save your destinations (work, home, gym...), stations and train stations as favorites<br>- Personalize your profile (fast walker, with difficulties, reduced mobility...)<br>- Select lines or stations to avoid<br> <br>Favour soft or alternative modes of transport:<br>- Prefer the proposed bike routes for all your trips<br>- Book your carpooling and/or carsharing trips, in partnership with the main French players<br>- Rent a car or a utility for a short period of time by choosing a Communauto car-sharing vehicle from a large choice of stations around you and reserve it without delay for the duration of your choice.<br> <br>--You already use the \u00cele-de-France Mobilit\u00e9s application and appreciate its services? Let us know with 5 stars!<br>Do you have any bugs or comments to share with us? Help us improve by sending us your suggestions using the contact form available via the menu.",
